{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — Become a Host · Step 1 (Application Form)
   templates/host/become_a_host.html.twig

   First host-flow page in the Symfony port (NOT an account-area
   page — different shell family):

     - Shell: legacy host-page-v2 (own --hive-* design tokens,
       honeycomb ::before texture, glow blobs, step tracker,
       live progress bar). NOT the up-dashboard shell used by the
       account pages — NO sidebar, NO myaccount.css.
     - Navbar: shared partials/navbar.html.twig (current_page
       '/become-a-host'); user is logged in, not yet a host.
     - Footer: shared partials/footer.html.twig after </main>.
     - Lucide: guarded loader (window.__rhNavbarLucide — never
       double-runs with the navbar's) replaces the plain CDN tag.
       hiveRefreshIcons() is preserved as a thin alias so the
       form/upload IIFE's existing "refreshIcons()" init call
       keeps working unchanged.
     - Form: SELF-POSTS via action="" (HTML spec: an empty action
       submits to the current URL) — the legacy form pointed back
       at becomeahost.php, so this is the 1:1 equivalent. Route-
       name-agnostic: the first port used path('app_become_a_host')
       and threw "route does not exist" on render when the
       controller's route name didn't match (cont-32 fix). The
       controller route must therefore accept BOTH GET and POST on
       the same URL (methods: ['GET', 'POST']). The hidden
       csrf_token (csrf) is the controller's self-contained CSRF
       addition (session-stored token, validated via hash_equals —
       no SecurityBundle needed); the rest of the markup is 1:1.

   Controller contract (HostApplicationController::apply):
     errors          string[]   validation errors from prior POST
     form            array     submitted values for re-sticking
                               (full_name/email/phone/age/province/
                                city/id_type/id_number); prefilled
                                from the users row on first GET.
                                cont-43: 'location' was split into
                                province + city — the controller
                                reads $_POST['province'] and
                                $_POST['city'] separately, then
                                combines them into the DB's
                                location column ("City, Province").
                                cont-45: the form ALSO posts a hidden
                                `location` field kept in sync as
                                "City, Province" by JS — so a controller
                                that still validates/saves the legacy
                                single `location` key keeps working
                                unchanged. The template re-sticks
                                province/city from form.location
                                (split on the comma) when the render
                                array only carries the legacy key.
     hostSteps       array     4-step tracker config
     currentHostStep int       active step number (1 on this page)
     csrf            string    CSRF token for the form
     is_logged_in    bool      navbar guard (always true here)
     nav_avatar      string    navbar avatar URL
     current_page    string    navbar active-marker ('/become-a-host')

   ⚠ RECONSTRUCTED CONTENT — your pasted PHP was already
   reconstructed in three places (ID-type options past "sss",
   ID-number field, upload box markup, submit button label,
   page scripts). The Twig preserves that reconstruction 1:1 —
   verify the reconstructed option values (umid / philhealth /
   tin / postal) match what your DB actually stores.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>RoomHive - Become a Host</title>

        <!-- POPPINS FONT -->
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

        <!-- MAIN CSS -->
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">

        <!-- enables JS-gated entrance animations -->
        <script>
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <!-- =====================================================
             BECOME-A-HOST ENHANCEMENT LAYER (STEP 1)
        ====================================================== -->
        <style>
            .host-page-v2 {
                --hive-amber: #ecac3a;
                --hive-amber-dark: #cf8f1f;
                --hive-honey: #eda423;
                --hive-honey-light: #f6c04e;
                --hive-ink: #1c1d22;
                --hive-ink-soft: #565a66;
                --hive-cream: #fffaf1;
                --hive-line: #e9e2d3;
                --hive-good: #2f9e5b;
                --hive-bad: #e0524d;
                --hive-shadow: 0 18px 40px -22px rgba(28, 29, 34, 0.35);

                position: relative;
            }

            /* ---------- honeycomb texture + glow blobs ---------- */

            .host-page-v2::before {
                content: "";

                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;

                background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='28' height='49' viewBox='0 0 28 49' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='%23eda423' fill-opacity='0.07' fill-rule='nonzero'%3E%3Cpath d='M13.99 9.25l13 7.5v15l-13 7.5L1 31.75v-15l12.99-7.5zM3 17.9v12.7l10.99 6.34 11-6.35V17.9l-11-6.34L3 17.9zM0 15l12.98-7.5V0h-2v6.35L0 12.69v2.3zm0 18.5L12.98 41v8h-2v-6.85L0 35.81v-2.3zM15 0v7.5L27.99 15H28v-2.31h-.01L17 6.35V0h-2zm0 49v-8l12.99-7.5H28v2.31h-.01L17 42.15V49h-2z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
                background-size: 28px 49px;

                -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
                    180deg,
                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
                    transparent 55%
                );
                mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), transparent 55%);

                pointer-events: none;

                z-index: 0;
            }

            .host-page-v2 > * {
                position: relative;

                z-index: 1;
            }

            .hive-blob {
                position: absolute;

                border-radius: 50%;
                filter: blur(70px);

                pointer-events: none;

                z-index: 0;
            }

            .hive-blob-1 {
                width: 360px;
                height: 360px;

                top: -140px;
                right: -120px;

                background: radial-gradient(
                    circle at 30% 30%,
                    rgba(246, 196, 78, 0.8),
                    rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.22) 60%,
                    transparent 75%
                );

                animation: hiveDrift 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
            }

            .hive-blob-2 {
                width: 260px;
                height: 260px;

                top: 420px;
                left: -140px;

                background: radial-gradient(
                    circle at 60% 40%,
                    rgba(246, 196, 78, 0.6),
                    rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.18) 60%,
                    transparent 75%
                );

                animation: hiveDrift 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse;
            }

            /* ---------- entrance (one orchestrated reveal) ---------- */

            @keyframes hiveRise {
                from {
                    opacity: 0;
                    transform: translateY(14px);
                }

                to {
                    opacity: 1;
                    transform: translateY(0);
                }
            }

            .js .host-page-v2 .host-header,
            .js .host-page-v2 .host-form-card {
                animation: hiveRise 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
            }

            .js .host-page-v2 .host-form-card {
                animation-delay: 0.08s;
            }

            /* ---------- header polish ---------- */

            .host-page-v2 .host-header {
                text-align: center;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .hero-badge {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 8px;

                padding: 8px 16px;

                background: #ffffff;

                border: 1px solid rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35);
                border-radius: 999px;

                box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.12);

                color: #b07708;

                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            .hive-pulse-dot {
                position: relative;

                width: 8px;
                height: 8px;

                background: var(--hive-honey);
                border-radius: 50%;
            }

            .hive-pulse-dot::after {
                content: "";

                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;

                background: var(--hive-honey);
                border-radius: 50%;

                animation: hivePing 1.8s cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-header h1 {
                position: relative;

                display: inline-block;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-header h1::after {
                content: "";

                position: absolute;

                width: 64px;
                height: 4px;

                left: 50%;
                bottom: -14px;
                margin-left: -32px;

                background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f6b93b, var(--hive-honey));

                border-radius: 2px;
            }

            .hive-shimmer {
                background: linear-gradient(92deg, #eda423 0%, #f6c04e 45%, #eda423 90%);
                background-size: 200% auto;

                -webkit-background-clip: text;
                background-clip: text;
                -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
                color: transparent;

                animation: hiveShimmer 3.5s linear infinite;
            }

            /* ---------- step tracker ---------- */

            .host-page-v2 .host-steps {
                position: relative;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-step {
                transition: transform 0.25s ease;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-step[data-state="current"] .step-circle {
                box-shadow:
                    0 0 0 5px rgba(236, 172, 58, 0.28),
                    var(--hive-shadow);
                transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-step[data-state="current"] .step-number {
                background: var(--hive-amber);
                color: var(--hive-ink);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-step[data-state="upcoming"] {
                opacity: 0.55;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .step-tag {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 6px;
                padding: 3px 10px;
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 600;
                letter-spacing: 0.02em;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: rgba(236, 172, 58, 0.16);
                color: var(--hive-amber-dark);
            }

            /* ---------- progress bar ---------- */

            .host-progress {
                max-width: 760px;
                margin: 28px auto 0;
                padding: 0 4px;
            }

            .host-progress-top {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: baseline;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }

            .host-progress-top strong {
                color: var(--hive-ink);
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .host-progress-track {
                height: 8px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: var(--hive-line);
                overflow: hidden;
            }

            .host-progress-fill {
                height: 100%;
                width: 0%;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: linear-gradient(
                    90deg,
                    var(--hive-amber-dark),
                    var(--hive-amber)
                );
                transition: width 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            }

            /* ---------- error banner ---------- */

            .host-page-v2 .form-errors {
                max-width: 760px;
                margin: 24px auto 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 8px;
                border: 1px solid #f3c9c7;
                background: #fdf1f0;
                border-radius: 14px;
                padding: 16px 18px;
                animation: hiveRise 0.35s ease both;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-errors::before {
                content: "We need a couple of fixes before continuing";
                font-weight: 600;
                color: var(--hive-bad);
                margin-bottom: 2px;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-errors p {
                margin: 0;
                padding-left: 20px;
                position: relative;
                font-size: 14px;
                color: #7a2f2c;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-errors p::before {
                content: "!";
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                top: 0;
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: var(--hive-bad);
                color: #fff;
                font-size: 10px;
                line-height: 14px;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            /* ---------- form card + fields ---------- */

            .host-page-v2 .host-form-card {
                max-width: 760px;
                margin: 36px auto 0;
                box-shadow: var(--hive-shadow);
                border: 1px solid var(--hive-line);
                border-radius: 18px;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-heading h2 {
                position: relative;

                display: inline-block;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-heading h2::after {
                content: "";

                position: absolute;

                width: 42px;
                height: 3px;

                left: 0;
                bottom: -8px;

                background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f6b93b, var(--hive-honey));

                border-radius: 2px;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-heading p {
                margin-top: 18px;
            }

            /* explicit grid definitions — .three-columns was
                                                               previously only defined scoped to step 2's .rh-step2,
                                                               so step 1's grids could silently collapse. */

            .host-page-v2 .form-grid {
                display: grid;
                gap: 18px 20px;
                margin-bottom: 22px;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-grid .input-group {
                margin-bottom: 0;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-grid.two-columns {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-grid.three-columns {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }

            @media (max-width: 720px) {
                .host-page-v2 .form-grid.two-columns,
                .host-page-v2 .form-grid.three-columns {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
            }

            .host-page-v2 .input-group {
                position: relative;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .input-group label {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .input-group input,
            .host-page-v2 .input-group select {
                transition:
                    border-color 0.18s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.18s ease,
                    background-color 0.18s ease;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .input-group input:focus,
            .host-page-v2 .input-group select:focus {
                outline: none;
                border-color: var(--hive-amber-dark) !important;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(236, 172, 58, 0.18);
            }

            .field-hint {
                display: block;
                min-height: 16px;
                margin-top: 5px;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);
                transition: color 0.15s ease;
            }

            .input-group.is-valid input,
            .input-group.is-valid select {
                border-color: var(--hive-good) !important;
                background-image: none;
            }

            .input-group.is-valid .field-hint {
                color: var(--hive-good);
                font-weight: 500;
            }

            .input-group.is-invalid input,
            .input-group.is-invalid select {
                border-color: var(--hive-bad) !important;
            }

            .input-group.is-invalid .field-hint {
                color: var(--hive-bad);
                font-weight: 500;
            }

            @keyframes hiveShake {
                10%,
                90% {
                    transform: translateX(-1px);
                }

                20%,
                80% {
                    transform: translateX(2px);
                }

                30%,
                50%,
                70% {
                    transform: translateX(-4px);
                }

                40%,
                60% {
                    transform: translateX(4px);
                }
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-form-card.shake {
                animation: hiveShake 0.4s;
            }

            /* ---------- upload box ---------- */

            .host-page-v2 .upload-box {
                border: 2px dashed #e2d4b6;

                border-radius: 16px;

                background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fffdf6 0%, #fdf3e0 100%);

                cursor: pointer;

                transition:
                    border-color 0.2s ease,
                    background-color 0.2s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.25s ease,
                    transform 0.15s ease;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .upload-box:hover {
                border-color: var(--hive-honey);

                box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.16);

                transform: translateY(-2px);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .upload-box .upload-icon {
                color: var(--hive-honey);
                font-size: 32px;

                transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .upload-box:hover .upload-icon {
                transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.12);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .upload-box .upload-text strong {
                color: var(--hive-ink);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .upload-box .upload-text span {
                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);
            }

            .upload-box {
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

            .upload-box.drag-over {
                border-color: var(--hive-amber-dark) !important;
                background-color: rgba(236, 172, 58, 0.08);
                transform: scale(1.005);
            }

            /* Larger preview so the ID is actually legible once uploaded.
                                                               Only grows the box in its "has-image" state — the empty
                                                               click-to-upload state keeps its normal size. */
            .upload-box.has-image {
                min-height: 320px;
                background-color: #111418;
                background-repeat: no-repeat;
                background-position: center;
                background-size: contain;
                /* show the whole ID, not a cropped slice */
            }

            .upload-box.has-image .upload-icon,
            .upload-box.has-image .upload-text {
                display: none;
            }

            .upload-box-overlay {
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                z-index: 1;
                color: #ffffff;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                text-align: center;
                width: 100%;
                padding: 10px 12px;
                background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));
                animation: hiveRise 0.3s ease both;
            }

            .upload-box-overlay strong {
                max-width: 90%;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
                white-space: nowrap;
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .upload-box-overlay span {
                font-size: 12px;
                opacity: 0.85;
            }

            .upload-box-overlay .upload-check {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 4px;
                font-size: 11px;
                color: #9ee6b5;
                margin-top: 2px;
            }

            .upload-box .upload-remove-btn {
                position: absolute;
                top: 8px;
                right: 8px;
                z-index: 2;
                border: none;
                background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
                color: #ffffff;
                width: 28px;
                height: 28px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition:
                    background-color 0.15s ease,
                    transform 0.15s ease;

                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .upload-box .upload-remove-btn:hover {
                background: var(--hive-bad);
                transform: scale(1.08);
            }

            .upload-error {
                display: none;
                margin-top: 8px;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--hive-bad);
                font-weight: 500;
            }

            .upload-error.show {
                display: block;
            }

            /* trust note under the ID upload */

            .upload-secure-note {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 7px;

                margin-top: 10px;

                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);

                font-size: 12px;
            }

            .upload-secure-note svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;

                color: var(--hive-good);
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            @media (max-width: 600px) {
                .upload-box.has-image {
                    min-height: 220px;
                }
            }

            /* ---------- submit button ---------- */

            .host-page-v2 .next-button {
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;

                background: linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    var(--hive-honey-light),
                    var(--hive-honey)
                ) !important;

                border: none !important;

                color: var(--hive-ink) !important;

                font-weight: 700;

                box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35);

                transition:
                    transform 0.15s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.2s ease,
                    opacity 0.15s ease !important;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .next-button:not(:disabled):hover {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.45);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .next-button:not(:disabled):active {
                transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .next-button:disabled {
                opacity: 0.75;
                cursor: progress;
            }

            /* infinite shine sweep, matching steps 3 & 4 */

            .host-page-v2 .next-button::after {
                content: "";

                position: absolute;
                top: 0;
                left: -80%;

                width: 50%;
                height: 100%;

                background: linear-gradient(
                    100deg,
                    transparent,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55),
                    transparent
                );

                transform: skewX(-20deg);

                animation: hiveSweep 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;

                pointer-events: none;
            }

            @keyframes hiveSweep {
                0% {
                    left: -80%;
                }

                45%,
                100% {
                    left: 130%;
                }
            }

            .btn-spinner {
                display: none;
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                border: 2px solid rgba(28, 29, 34, 0.25);
                border-top-color: var(--hive-ink);
                margin-right: 8px;
                vertical-align: -2px;
                animation: hiveSpin 0.7s linear infinite;
            }

            @keyframes hiveSpin {
                to {
                    transform: rotate(360deg);
                }
            }

            .next-button.is-loading .btn-spinner {
                display: inline-block;
            }

            /* ---------- keyframes for the added decoration ---------- */

            @keyframes hiveDrift {
                from {
                    transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1);
                }

                to {
                    transform: translate(30px, -24px) scale(1.08);
                }
            }

            @keyframes hivePing {
                0% {
                    transform: scale(1);
                    opacity: 0.7;
                }

                80%,
                100% {
                    transform: scale(2.6);
                    opacity: 0;
                }
            }

            @keyframes hiveShimmer {
                to {
                    background-position: 200% center;
                }
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                                               LUCIDE ICONS (lucide.dev)
                                                               Lucide copies the placeholder's classes onto the
                                                               generated <svg>, so existing selectors keep working.
                                                            ====================================================== */

            svg.lucide {
                display: inline-block;
                vertical-align: -0.18em;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            /* Step tracker — Lucide replaces the old PNG icons */
            .host-page-v2 .step-circle svg {
                width: 30px;
                height: 30px;
                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);
                stroke-width: 1.9;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-step[data-state="current"] .step-circle svg {
                color: var(--hive-amber-dark);
            }

            .host-page-v2 .host-step[data-state="done"] .step-circle svg {
                color: var(--hive-good);
            }

            /* Field label icons */
            .host-page-v2 .input-group label svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
                color: var(--hive-honey-dark);
            }

            /* Location input trailing icon (kept inside its .input-with-icon
                                                               span so style.css positioning still applies) */
            .input-with-icon svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
            }

            /* Upload box */
            .host-page-v2 .upload-box .upload-icon {
                display: inline-flex;
            }

            .upload-box .upload-icon svg {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
            }

            .upload-box-overlay .upload-check svg {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                vertical-align: -2px;
            }

            .upload-box .upload-remove-btn svg {
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
            }

            /* [hidden] must win over the display:flex the overlay sets */
            .upload-box-overlay[hidden],
            .upload-remove-btn[hidden] {
                display: none !important;
            }

            /* Upload validity borders */
            .input-group.is-valid .upload-box {
                border-color: var(--hive-good) !important;
            }

            .input-group.is-invalid .upload-box {
                border-color: var(--hive-bad) !important;
            }

            /* Submit button */
            .next-button {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 6px;
            }

            .next-button svg {
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
            }

            .next-button.is-loading .next-arrow {
                display: none;
            }

            /* ---------- reduced motion (targeted, so the
                                                               loading spinner still spins for users who need it
                                                               to know the form is submitting) ---------- */

            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .hive-blob,
                .hive-pulse-dot::after,
                .hive-shimmer,
                .host-page-v2 .next-button::after,
                .host-page-v2 .upload-box .upload-icon {
                    animation: none !important;

                    opacity: 1 !important;
                    transform: none !important;
                }

                .js .host-page-v2 .host-header,
                .js .host-page-v2 .host-form-card {
                    animation: none !important;

                    opacity: 1 !important;
                    transform: none !important;
                }
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                                               PH LOCATION DROPDOWN — cities + provinces (cont-40)
                                                               Custom dropdown under #location on Step 1. Shows:
                                                                 1. CITIES matching the typed text first
                                                                    (each item displays "City, Province")
                                                                 2. PROVINCES matching the typed text second
                                                                    (each item displays the province name)
                                                               When a city is picked → input fills as "City, Province"
                                                               (with the comma). When a province is picked → input
                                                               fills as just the province name.
                                                               Pure JS, no API key, no external requests.
                                                            ===================================================== */

            /* =====================================================
                                                               PH LOCATION DROPDOWN (cont-43)
                                                               Two independent dropdown instances — one under the
                                                               #province input, one under the #city input. Each is a
                                                               single-panel dropdown (header + list) anchored to its
                                                               input's .input-with-icon wrapper. The same CSS drives
                                                               both instances; the JS creates one per field.
                                                               Replaces cont-40/42's combined single-dropdown with
                                                               the two-section structure.
                                                            ===================================================== */

            .host-page-v2 .input-with-icon > .rh-location-dropdown {
                position: absolute;
                top: 100%;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                max-height: 300px;
                overflow-y: auto;
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1px solid var(--hive-line);
                border-radius: 12px;
                box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -12px rgba(28, 29, 34, 0.3);
                margin-top: 4px;
                z-index: 1000;
                display: none;
                font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .input-with-icon > .rh-location-dropdown.is-open {
                display: block;
            }

            /* STACKING LIFT WHILE OPEN (cont-44 — "can't click the
                                                               suggestions" fix):
                                                               The user's assets/style.css positions .input-group
                                                               (and possibly .form-grid), which turns every group and
                                                               row into its own stacking context. The dropdown lives
                                                               inside the PROVINCE group's context, so LATER groups
                                                               (Row 4's ID Type label + select, the City group, etc.)
                                                               painted ABOVE the open dropdown — it looked fine but
                                                               clicks landed on those invisible elements instead of
                                                               the suggestions. Fix: while a dropdown is open, JS adds
                                                               rh-dd-host / rh-dd-host-group / rh-dd-host-row to the
                                                               input's wrapper, group and grid row, jumping that whole
                                                               chain to z-index 5000 — above every sibling group and
                                                               row regardless of what style.css does. Classes are
                                                               removed on close, so nothing changes while closed. */
            .host-page-v2 .input-with-icon.rh-dd-host {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 5000;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .input-group.rh-dd-host-group {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 5000;
            }

            .host-page-v2 .form-grid.rh-dd-host-row {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 5000;
            }

            /* pointer-events insurance — never let an inherited
                                                               pointer-events: none from style.css eat the picks */
            .host-page-v2 .input-with-icon > .rh-location-dropdown.is-open {
                pointer-events: auto;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-header {
                display: block;
                padding: 8px 14px;
                font-size: 10.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);
                background: var(--hive-cream);
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hive-line);
                border-top-left-radius: 12px;
                border-top-right-radius: 12px;
                position: sticky;
                top: 0;
                z-index: 1;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-list {
                display: block;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 10px;
                padding: 9px 14px;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #1c1d22;
                border-top: 1px solid var(--hive-line);
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item:first-of-type {
                border-top: none;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item:hover,
            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item.is-highlighted {
                background-color: var(--hive-cream);
            }

            /* SPANS INSIDE DROPDOWN ITEMS — CRITICAL (cont-41 fix):
                                                               The page's global rule `.host-page-v2 .input-with-icon span`
                                                               (specificity 0,0,2,1) — meant for the location input's
                                                               trailing map-pin icon — would otherwise absolute-position
                                                               EVERY <span> inside .input-with-icon, including these
                                                               dropdown spans, pinning them all to the right edge of
                                                               the input, causing them to overlap on top of each
                                                               other AND the item name (the cont-41 bug — same root
                                                               cause as cont-38 on Step 2). We use 3-class selectors
                                                               (0,0,3,0) which beat the global 2-class+1-type rule
                                                               AND explicitly reset position/right/top/transform so
                                                               no inherited absolute positioning bleeds through. */
            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item .rh-location-icon {
                color: var(--hive-honey);
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
                position: static;
                right: auto;
                top: auto;
                transform: none;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item .rh-location-icon svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
                display: block;
                /* cont-44: style.css positions .input-with-icon svg
                                                                   absolutely (it drives the input's trailing pin) —
                                                                   reset that here or every item's pin flies to the
                                                                   input's right edge and stacks into a pile. */
                position: static;
                right: auto;
                top: auto;
                transform: none;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item .rh-location-name {
                flex: 1 1 auto;
                min-width: 0;
                font-weight: 500;
                color: #1c1d22;
                font-size: 13px;
                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
                position: static;
                right: auto;
                top: auto;
                transform: none;
            }

            /* Sub-label shows the province for city items
                                                               (e.g. "Dumaguete — Negros Oriental") */
            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item .rh-location-sub {
                font-size: 11.5px;
                color: var(--hive-ink-soft);
                font-weight: 400;
                margin-left: 2px;
                position: static;
                right: auto;
                top: auto;
                transform: none;
            }

            .rh-location-dropdown .rh-location-item .rh-location-tag {
                font-size: 10px;
                font-weight: 600;
                letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: var(--hive-amber-dark);
                background: rgba(236, 172, 58, 0.16);
                padding: 3px 9px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                display: inline-block;
                position: static;
                right: auto;
                top: auto;
                transform: none;
            }
        </style>
    </head>

    <body>

        {# =========================================================
           NAVBAR — shared partial (the user is logged in, not yet
           a host — that's why this page exists at all). The
           legacy file also included notification_dropdown.php
           separately; the navbar partial owns the dropdown now,
           so a single include is enough.
        ========================================================= #}
        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: is_logged_in ?? true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: nav_avatar ?? '/images/default-avatar.png',
            notification_count: notification_count ?? notif_count ?? 0,
            current_page: current_page ?? '/become-a-host'
        }) }}

        <!-- =========================================================
             MAIN HOST PAGE
        ========================================================== -->
        <main class="host-page host-page-v2">

            <!-- decorative glow blobs (honeycomb lives on ::before) -->
            <span class="hive-blob hive-blob-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="hive-blob hive-blob-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>

            <!-- =================================================
                 HOST HEADER
            ================================================== -->
            <section class="host-header">

                <span class="hero-badge">
                    <span class="hive-pulse-dot"></span>
                    Host Application &middot; Step 1 of 4
                </span>

                <span class="host-eyebrow" style="display:block; margin-top:18px;">
                    BECOME A HOST
                </span>

                <h1>
                    Start Hosting in
                    <span class="hive-shimmer">4 Easy Steps</span>
                </h1>

                {# =================================================
                   HOST STEPS — icons are Lucide SVGs.
                   The controller (HostApplicationController::apply)
                   passes hostSteps + currentHostStep; the |default
                   fallbacks keep the page renderable without a
                   controller (e.g. during static prototyping).
                ================================================== #}
                {% set host_steps = hostSteps|default([
                    { number: 1, icon: 'user-plus',      alt: 'Create Account',  title: 'Create Account',  description: 'Sign up as a host in minutes' },
                    { number: 2, icon: 'home',           alt: 'Add Your Space',   title: 'Add Your Space',   description: 'Tell us about your property' },
                    { number: 3, icon: 'image-plus',     alt: 'Upload Photos',    title: 'Upload Photos',    description: 'Show your space to attract renters' },
                    { number: 4, icon: 'calendar-check', alt: 'Get Bookings',     title: 'Get Bookings',     description: 'Approve bookings and start earning' }
                ]) %}
                {% set current_host_step = currentHostStep|default(1) %}

                <div class="host-steps" style="margin-top:36px;">

                    {% for step in host_steps %}
                        {% set step_state = step.number == current_host_step
                            ? 'current'
                            : (step.number < current_host_step ? 'done' : 'upcoming') %}

                        <div class="host-step" data-state="{{ step_state }}">

                            <!-- ICON (Lucide — "alt" is reused as the accessible label) -->
                            <div class="step-circle">
                                <i data-lucide="{{ step.icon }}" role="img" aria-label="{{ step.alt }}"></i>
                            </div>

                            <!-- CONNECTING LINE -->
                            {% if not loop.last %}
                                <div class="step-line"></div>
                            {% endif %}

                            <!-- NUMBER -->
                            <div class="step-number">{{ step.number }}</div>

                            <!-- TITLE -->
                            <h3>{{ step.title }}</h3>

                            <!-- DESCRIPTION -->
                            <p>{{ step.description }}</p>

                            {% if step_state == 'current' %}
                                <span class="step-tag">You're here</span>
                            {% endif %}

                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}

                </div>

                {# =================================================
                   FORM COMPLETION PROGRESS
                   Updated live by JS as required fields are filled.
                ================================================== #}
                <div class="host-progress">
                    <div class="host-progress-top">
                        <span>Application details</span>
                        <span><strong id="progressCount">0</strong> of <span id="progressTotal">9</span> fields complete</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="host-progress-track">
                        <div class="host-progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </section>

            <!-- =====================================================
                 ERROR MESSAGES
            ====================================================== -->
            {% if errors is not empty %}

                <div class="form-errors" role="alert" aria-live="assertive">
                    {% for error in errors %}
                        <p>{{ error }}</p>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>

            {% endif %}

            <!-- =====================================================
                 HOST FORM
            ====================================================== -->
            <section class="host-form-card">

                <!-- FORM HEADING -->
                <div class="form-heading">
                    <h2>Tell Us About You</h2>
                    <p>Let's get to know you first.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- FORM -->
                <form
                    action=""
                    method="POST"
                    enctype="multipart/form-data"
                    id="hostForm"
                    novalidate
                >

                    {# Symfony CSRF — added in the port (legacy PHP had none).
                       Controller should validate via hash_equals
                       against the session-stored token, same pattern
                       as MessagesController::send / HelpController. #}
                    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{ csrf ?? '' }}">

                    <!-- =================================================
                         ROW 1 — rebalanced grids: 2 + 2 + 3, no orphans.
                    ================================================== -->
                    <div class="form-grid two-columns">

                        <!-- FULL NAME -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="full_name">
                            <label for="full_name">
                                <i data-lucide="user" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                Full Name
                            </label>
                            <input
                                type="text"
                                id="full_name"
                                name="full_name"
                                placeholder="Enter your full name"
                                value="{{ form.full_name|default('') }}"
                                aria-describedby="hint_full_name"
                                required
                            >
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_full_name"></small>
                        </div>

                        <!-- EMAIL -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="email">
                            <label for="email">
                                <i data-lucide="mail" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                Email Address
                            </label>
                            <input
                                type="email"
                                id="email"
                                name="email"
                                placeholder="Enter your email"
                                value="{{ form.email|default('') }}"
                                aria-describedby="hint_email"
                                required
                            >
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_email"></small>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <!-- =================================================
                         ROW 2
                    ================================================== -->
                    <div class="form-grid two-columns">

                        <!-- PHONE -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="phone">
                            <label for="phone">
                                <i data-lucide="phone" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                Phone Number
                            </label>
                            <input
                                type="tel"
                                id="phone"
                                name="phone"
                                placeholder="09XX XXX XXXX"
                                value="{{ form.phone|default('') }}"
                                pattern="09[0-9]{9}"
                                maxlength="11"
                                minlength="11"
                                inputmode="numeric"
                                aria-describedby="hint_phone"
                                required
                            >
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_phone">Must start with 09 — e.g. 09171234567</small>
                        </div>

                        <!-- AGE -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="age">
                            <label for="age">
                                <i data-lucide="cake" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                Age
                            </label>
                            <input
                                type="number"
                                id="age"
                                name="age"
                                placeholder="Enter your age"
                                min="18"
                                max="120"
                                value="{{ form.age|default('') }}"
                                aria-describedby="hint_age"
                                required
                            >
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_age">You must be 18 or older to become a host.</small>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <!-- =================================================
                         ROW 3 — PROVINCE / CITY (cont-43)
                         The old single "Location" field is now TWO
                         fields: Province (upper) + City (lower).
                         Each has its own suggestion dropdown. The
                         controller combines them into the DB's
                         location column as "City, Province" on save.
                    ================================================== -->
                    <div class="form-grid two-columns">

                        <!-- PROVINCE -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="province">
                            <label for="province">
                                <i data-lucide="map-pin" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                Province
                            </label>
                            <div class="input-with-icon">
                                <input
                                    type="text"
                                    id="province"
                                    name="province"
                                    placeholder="Select or type a province"
                                    value="{{ form.province|default(form.location|default('')|split(',')|last|trim) }}"
                                    aria-describedby="hint_province"
                                    required
                                >
                                <span aria-hidden="true">
                                    <i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_province"></small>
                        </div>

                        <!-- CITY / MUNICIPALITY -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="city">
                            <label for="city">
                                <i data-lucide="building-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                City / Municipality
                            </label>
                            <div class="input-with-icon">
                                <input
                                    type="text"
                                    id="city"
                                    name="city"
                                    placeholder="Select or type your city"
                                    value="{{ form.city|default(form.location|default('')|split(',')|first|trim) }}"
                                    aria-describedby="hint_city"
                                    required
                                >
                                <span aria-hidden="true">
                                    <i data-lucide="building-2"></i>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_city"></small>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <!-- =================================================
                         HIDDEN location FIELD (cont-45)
                         Since cont-43 the visible form posts `province`
                         and `city` separately — but a controller that
                         still validates/saves the legacy single
                         `location` key would then ALWAYS fail with
                         "enter your location" even when both fields
                         are filled. This hidden input carries the
                         legacy format ("City, Province"): JS below
                         keeps it in sync on every keystroke and at
                         submit time. Controllers reading province +
                         city simply ignore it — both versions work.
                    ================================================== -->
                    <input
                        type="hidden"
                        name="location"
                        id="rhLocationField"
                        value="{{ form.location|default('') }}"
                    >

                    <!-- =================================================
                         ROW 4
                    ================================================== -->
                    <div class="form-grid two-columns">

                        <!-- ID TYPE -->
                        <!-- ⚠ RECONSTRUCTED (paste cut off inside the "sss" option):
                             umid / philhealth / tin / postal are guesses —
                             VERIFY they match what your DB stores. -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="id_type">
                            <label for="id_type">
                                <i data-lucide="id-card" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                ID Type
                            </label>
                            <select
                                id="id_type"
                                name="id_type"
                                aria-describedby="hint_id_type"
                                required
                            >

                                <option value="" disabled {{ form.id_type|default('') == '' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    Select ID Type
                                </option>

                                <option value="passport" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'passport' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    Passport
                                </option>

                                <option value="drivers-license" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'drivers-license' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    Driver's License
                                </option>

                                <option value="philid" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'philid' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    PhilID / National ID
                                </option>

                                <option value="sss" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'sss' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    SSS ID
                                </option>

                                <!-- ⚠ RECONSTRUCTED below this line — verify values -->
                                <option value="umid" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'umid' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    UMID
                                </option>

                                <option value="philhealth" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'philhealth' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    PhilHealth ID
                                </option>

                                <option value="tin" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'tin' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    TIN ID
                                </option>

                                <option value="postal" {{ form.id_type|default('') == 'postal' ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    Postal ID
                                </option>
                            </select>
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_id_type"></small>
                        </div>

                        <!-- ID NUMBER -->
                        <!-- ⚠ RECONSTRUCTED (paste cut off here) -->
                        <div class="input-group" data-field="id_number">
                            <label for="id_number">
                                <i data-lucide="hash" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                ID Number
                            </label>
                            <input
                                type="text"
                                id="id_number"
                                name="id_number"
                                placeholder="Enter your ID number"
                                value="{{ form.id_number|default('') }}"
                                aria-describedby="hint_id_number"
                                required
                            >
                            <small class="field-hint" id="hint_id_number"></small>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <!-- =================================================
                         UPLOAD VALID ID
                         ⚠ RECONSTRUCTED (paste cut off here) — markup
                         matches the existing CSS hooks (.upload-box,
                         .has-image, .drag-over, .upload-box-overlay,
                         .upload-remove-btn, .upload-error,
                         .upload-secure-note).
                    ================================================== -->
                    <div class="input-group" data-field="upload_id">

                        <label>
                            <i data-lucide="upload" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            Upload Valid ID
                        </label>

                        <div
                            class="upload-box"
                            id="uploadBox"
                            role="button"
                            tabindex="0"
                            aria-label="Upload your valid ID — click, or drag and drop an image"
                        >

                            <input
                                type="file"
                                id="upload_id"
                                name="upload_id"
                                accept="image/jpeg,image/png"
                                hidden
                            >

                            <span class="upload-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                <i data-lucide="cloud-upload"></i>
                            </span>

                            <div class="upload-text">
                                <strong>Click to upload</strong>
                                <br>
                                <span>or drag and drop &middot; JPG or PNG &middot; max 5MB</span>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Remove button (shown once an image is loaded) -->
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="upload-remove-btn"
                                id="uploadRemove"
                                aria-label="Remove uploaded image"
                                hidden
                            >
                                <i data-lucide="x" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            </button>

                            <!-- Overlay (shown once an image is loaded) -->
                            <div class="upload-box-overlay" id="uploadOverlay" hidden>
                                <strong id="uploadFileName"></strong>
                                <span>Preview ready</span>
                                <span class="upload-check">
                                    <i data-lucide="circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    Image loaded
                                </span>
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <p class="upload-error" id="uploadError" role="alert"></p>

                        <p class="upload-secure-note">
                            <i data-lucide="shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            Your ID is stored securely and only visible to RoomHive admins
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <!-- SUBMIT -->
                    <!-- ⚠ RECONSTRUCTED button label — change "Next Step" if
                         your original said something else -->
                    <button type="submit" class="next-button" id="nextBtn">
                        <span class="btn-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="next-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span class="next-label">Next Step</span>
                    </button>

                </form>

            </section>

        </main>

